WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.470 --> 00:00:04.650
- Last night, I saw something
that I never thought

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:07.180
I would ever see on American soil.

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:11.410
It was the stuff of tin-pot
dictators in banana republics.

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:14.240
As you probably know,
throughout the entire country,

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:17.030
our protests against police brutality

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:19.660
and systemic unfairness and racism.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:22.190
So of course, because this is 2020,

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:25.460
the thing that was used
to fight those protesting,

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:27.220
that unfairness and brutality,

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:30.440
was yet more unfairness and brutality.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:32.990
I never thought I would ever see anything

00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:35.800
like what happened last night in America.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.640
What I saw last night was
a threat to our democracy,

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:42.610
not foreign, but domestic.

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:47.470
A violation of rights,
of freedoms, and of laws

00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:49.340
by the very people who are supposed

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:51.960
to protect and execute those laws.

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:55.233
Lafayette Square is a place
that I know very, very well.

00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:57.740
I worked downtown for years,

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:00.930
and I would often go to Lafayette Park,

00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:05.610
for a coffee or to have lunch outside, and

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:10.850
it's a beautiful park, right
in front of the White House.

00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:12.910
It's also the site of many protests.

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:14.900
There are actually protests there,

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:17.410
basically 365 days a year,

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:20.640
there are people who
literally camp out intense.

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:22.790
And given its proximity
to the White House,

00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:28.400
it makes sense as one of the
clear protest sites of choice.

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:32.180
There have been protests
there for decades,

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:34.590
if not hundreds, literally
hundreds of years.

00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:37.050
And while President
Trump was giving a speech

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:42.890
about domination, he gave
the order to clear out

00:01:42.890 --> 00:01:45.270
all of the protesters who were at

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:47.920
and in front of Lafayette Park.

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:52.280
President Trump's speech
began shortly after 6 p.m.

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:55.993
He gave the order to clear
out the park at 6:35 p.m.

00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:59.690
It was a sign of a peaceful protest.

00:01:59.690 --> 00:02:03.100
Not all of these protests
have been peaceful,

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:05.930
but the one in Lafayette Park was.

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:10.053
It was attended by peaceful
protesters, by the media.

00:02:12.430 --> 00:02:16.990
- As we speak, I am dispatching
thousands and thousands

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:21.120
of heavily armed soldiers,
military personnel,

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:26.120
and law enforcement offices
to stop the rioting, looting,

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:31.260
vandalism, assaults, and the
wanton destruction of property.

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:36.840
- And at 6:35 p.m. he gave the
order to round everyone up,

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:38.410
to clear them out.

00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:40.710
And someone whether it was the President

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:42.970
or those acting under his orders,

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:46.870
tear gassed the protesters,
shot them with rubber munitions,

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:48.270
and generally just beat the.

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:52.100
Federal officers armed to the teeth,

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:54.810
wearing protective riot
gear dressed in all black,

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:57.980
clad with plastic shields and backed up

00:02:57.980 --> 00:03:01.730
by what was effectively cavalry on horses,

00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:04.650
began rounding everyone
up and pushing them out.

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:06.220
This was the sort of tactic

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:09.040
that was designed to get violent.

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:11.890
Years of study of crowd
control have shown that

00:03:11.890 --> 00:03:13.720
the way to de-escalate
a situation like this

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:16.090
is effectively to do the exact opposite.

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:19.750
And get these federal
officers wearing riot gear

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:23.810
effectively tried to bum
rush out peaceful protesters.

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:25.910
They came out swinging, literally.

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:27.210
There's a video circulating of what

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:28.860
one of these federal officers did

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:30.690
to an Australian news crew,

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:33.540
after running towards the protesters.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:36.130
This particular officer started punching

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:39.640
and using his shield as a weapon.

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:43.440
He hits the Australian cameraman
directly in the stomach,

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:45.030
beats him up, sends him on his way.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:47.250
We have video footage not only of

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:49.440
what one of the protesters saw happening

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:51.410
to this Australian camera crew,

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:54.013
but also from the camera crew itself.

00:03:58.030 --> 00:03:59.807
- We are really surrounded by the police

00:03:59.807 --> 00:04:02.170
and you really saw the way that I dealt

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:03.360
with my cameraman team.

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:04.630
They're quite violent.

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:07.290
- What was the reason for expelling

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:09.780
these peaceful protesters
who were exercising

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:12.270
their constitutional right to protest?

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:14.350
The President wanted a photo op

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:16.450
at a church across the street.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:19.460
He wanted to be able to
walk from the White House,

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:22.210
out the front door, which is rarely done,

00:04:22.210 --> 00:04:23.800
through Lafayette Park,

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:27.170
to stand in front of St John's Church,

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:30.420
a non-partisan place of worship.

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:32.980
Reports are that little to no warning

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:35.470
was given to the protesters ahead of time.

00:04:35.470 --> 00:04:36.860
And that it was coordinated so that

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:39.140
he could end his speech
in the Rose Garden,

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:40.980
and walk directly out to the church.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:42.960
- I'm going to pay my respects

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:45.180
to a very, very special place.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:46.393
Thank you very much.

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:50.410
- Of course, when he got to the church

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:54.450
for his photo opportunity, he
turned his back on the church.

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:57.340
He didn't pray, he didn't reflect.

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:59.930
He didn't even open the
Bible he carried with him.

00:04:59.930 --> 00:05:02.470
He took it out, held it upside down,

00:05:02.470 --> 00:05:04.300
move it around in different ways

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:06.610
to get the best photo opportunity,

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:09.000
stood in front of the
church for a minute or two,

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:12.205
told the media that it was a Bible.

00:05:12.205 --> 00:05:14.210
- [Interviewer] Is that your Bible?

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:15.043
- It's a bible.

00:05:15.043 --> 00:05:16.490
- And then left.

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:18.590
He cleared out the protesters

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:21.780
before the 7 p.m. DC
curfew went into effect.

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:23.800
And then in the ultimate irony,

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.500
the President of law and order

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:29.360
stayed past the curfew
to get his photo op.

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:33.420
And of course, the cherry on top is that,

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:35.820
after the crowd was being dispersed,

00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:37.400
the federal government employed

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:41.550
military Black Hawk
helicopters in a show of force,

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:45.570
flying dozens of feet above the crowd

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:48.990
in an incredibly dangerous maneuver

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:51.860
that I can't recall anything like it

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:53.760
ever happening on American soil.

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:56.140
Nothing about the President's speech,

00:05:56.140 --> 00:05:59.670
or his photo opportunity
was about reconciliation,

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:02.320
about progress, about repair,

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:07.070
or even about amelioration or
de-escalation of the protests.

00:06:07.070 --> 00:06:11.230
It was calculated only to
inflame, to make things worse,

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:14.090
to own the libs while
desecrating a religious site,

00:06:14.090 --> 00:06:15.760
while blaspheming the Bible

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:17.840
and beating out of the protesters.

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:22.040
And we saw the end result of
this callous move this morning,

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:24.920
just mere hours after it happened.

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:27.500
The White House releases a video montage

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:29.030
set to music the next day,

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:32.870
a campaign stunt brought
to you by tear gassing.

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:36.730
Some people like Scott Walker
had the audacity to say that,

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:38.330
no one else would have the guts

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:41.080
to do what President Trump did,

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.980
to walk out in front of the crowd.

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:45.150
Yeah, it sure takes a real man

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:47.440
to order other people with guns

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:49.480
to fire munitions to its civilians.

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:51.250
American citizens exercising

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:53.320
their constitutional right to protest,

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:55.700
and then walk between 100 armed guards

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:58.790
and Secret Service members
for a two minute photo op

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:00.330
after clearing the area.

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:01.580
Real guts.

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:04.440
Now, I've been referring
to these armed guards

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:07.880
as federal officers,
because all reports show

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:09.810
that these were not DC cops.

00:07:09.810 --> 00:07:12.940
DC police generally know
how to do crowd control.

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:17.730
And while we all have issues
with the DC police department,

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:19.870
the Metropolitan Police Department.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:22.850
I'd like to think that
DC cops wouldn't stand

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:25.510
for being puppets of the
President so he can get a photo op

00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:28.420
while infringing on people's
constitutional rights.

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:30.800
Apparently, the DC police
were given minimal notice,

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.580
they were surprised as everyone else.

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:35.240
And one of the ultimate
ironies of this whole situation

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:38.040
is that not only were the
DC police totally uninformed

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:41.940
about this maneuver,
but one of the priests

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:45.200
who was one of the proprietors
of St John's Church,

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:47.830
where the President wanted to
have his photo opportunity,

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:49.860
was expelled from the area

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:51.730
so the President could stand there.

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:55.710
Mayor Bowser, the mayor of DC confirmed

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:57.730
that nothing in this particular situation,

00:07:57.730 --> 00:08:00.640
warranted the use of munitions
against the protesters,

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:03.320
or the tactics of the riot police.

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:06.850
- What we saw was before the curfew time,

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:10.500
munitions were released on people

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:14.660
who didn't seem to have
provoked any attack.

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:17.760
- And all of the people in
this particular area of DC,

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:20.080
were in fact, peacefully protesting.

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:22.490
On this channel, I
tried to give both sides

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:24.380
when there are both sides to a story,

00:08:24.380 --> 00:08:25.670
they're usually are.

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:27.920
And in this particular case, yes,

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:30.970
there were looting and riots
in other parts of the country,

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:32.920
but they weren't at the White House.

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:35.980
No one is supporting the
rioters and the looters,

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:37.830
but that's not what was going on here.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:39.480
And it could also be the case

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:43.240
that there are bad faith rioters
and protesters and looters

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:46.050
who are part of an
otherwise peaceful protest,

00:08:46.050 --> 00:08:47.610
that's not the issue here.

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:51.290
The issue here is that
unequivocally draconian tactics

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:53.720
were used on peaceful protesters.

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:57.410
Before curfew started, the stories

00:08:57.410 --> 00:09:00.850
about the violent protests
and the unlawful looting

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:03.890
and rioting deserve their own place

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:06.690
on the front page of the New York Times.

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:09.470
But those stories as of today deserve

00:09:09.470 --> 00:09:11.180
to be at the bottom of the front page,

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:13.780
because the headline
that should be ringing

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:16.430
in every house in America
is that the President

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:20.440
of the United States
ordered draconian measures

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:23.630
to expel peaceful protesters
so he could get a photo op.

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:26.410
I don't know if it's possible
to overdose on metaphors,

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:29.730
but today is actually Election Day in DC.

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:31.010
I don't know.

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:33.390
Something about this whole situation,

00:09:33.390 --> 00:09:36.550
feels different to me on
many different fronts.

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:40.150
Maybe there are more cameras
out today than in the past,

00:09:40.150 --> 00:09:43.300
and maybe we're just seeing
more of what was already there,

00:09:43.300 --> 00:09:44.850
and I'm sure that's the case.

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:47.670
But I also wonder if
there is more police abuse

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:48.930
that we're seeing as well.

00:09:48.930 --> 00:09:51.480
When you declare war on America,

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:53.990
what you get is a war on America,

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:57.500
that when you have federal
officers and police

00:09:57.500 --> 00:10:01.390
dress up like soldiers, they
start acting like soldiers.

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:03.910
I think in part, what we're seeing today

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:06.920
is the result of years of
the President's statements.

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:09.310
Like, if you have a suspect in custody,

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:11.080
feel free to rough them up.

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:12.660
Don't be too nice on them.

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:14.580
The press is the enemy of the people,

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:16.830
and that we need to dominate protesters,

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:19.310
making no distinction between looters

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:20.930
and peaceful protesters.

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.950
Words have consequences.

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:24.790
The President has a bully pulpit.

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:27.590
And we shouldn't be surprised when people

00:10:27.590 --> 00:10:30.560
actually follow the words
of an authority figure

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:32.470
like the President of the United States.

00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:36.440
Even though I am a relatively new adopter

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:40.140
of the city of Washington
DC as their home,

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:41.530
I have adopted it.

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:42.940
I chose to live here.

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:46.210
It's my home, and it's
where I'm gonna stay.

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:49.270
DC is a city that has been scarred

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:52.480
by the 1968 riots in many ways.

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:55.590
It's only in the last say 10 years

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:57.400
that it's really begun to heal.

00:10:57.400 --> 00:11:02.010
And I've seen nothing in
the last 24 to 48 hours

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:04.400
that has done anything
to make things better.

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:06.690
And the actions that were taken today,

00:11:06.690 --> 00:11:08.430
threaten that fragile piece.

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:11.610
It threatens DC sovereignty, as it were.

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:15.480
DC is not a state, we
don't have a governor.

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:19.430
Often, the city can't
refuse federal troops.

00:11:19.430 --> 00:11:23.370
And we don't have the
representatives, the senators,

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:26.610
the governors and all
of the other privileges

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:28.060
that the other states have to be able

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:30.930
to fight the federal government
in the way that they can.

00:11:30.930 --> 00:11:34.210
This is one of the reasons why
DC statehood is so important.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:39.210
Just yesterday morning,
and those naive days,

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:40.950
I was reading an opinion piece

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:43.640
by noted conservative
pundit George F Will.

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:45.430
He wrote in The Washington Post,

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:50.060
starting by referring to
the President's tweets

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:52.640
about Joe Scarborough stating,

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:55.600
those who think our unhinged
President's recent mania

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:58.200
about a murder two decades
ago that never happened,

00:11:58.200 --> 00:11:59.920
represents his moral nadir,

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:02.110
have missed the lessons of his life.

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:04.540
There is no such thing as rock bottom.

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:07.080
So assume that the worst is yet to come.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:10.050
I read those words, and I honestly thought

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:12.390
that George Will was overreacting.

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:15.150
I thought it was a little histrionic.

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:18.420
And then of course, because it's 2020,

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:21.200
we all have to eat our own words.

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:23.330
And then Lafayette Park happened.

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:24.650
Yesterday, the President said--

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:27.700
- I am your President of law and order.

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:30.310
- This is a President who just weeks ago,

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:32.660
abdicated all federal responsibility

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:35.130
regarding COVID and the Coronavirus,

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:37.220
calling it a states rights issue,

00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:39.690
and that the governor should
do something about it.

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:43.300
And now when it suits him,
he aggrandizes himself

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:47.770
control of all of the federal
officers and the military,

00:12:47.770 --> 00:12:49.670
so that he can do a photo opportunity.

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:52.660
- If a city or state
refuses to take the actions

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:56.130
that are necessary to
defend the life and property

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:58.790
of their residents, then I will deploy

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:00.910
the United States Military

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:04.500
and quickly solve the problem for them.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:07.810
- And he abuses the
authority of the military.

00:13:07.810 --> 00:13:11.360
This is the kind of show of force

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:14.550
that actually escalates
into more violence,

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:18.310
which is obviously exactly
what some people want.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:22.330
Now, things can and will get better.

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:24.040
It might not feel like it,

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:27.900
but police shootings nationally
are down and going lower.

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:31.250
Shootings of unarmed
people are going down,

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:33.680
and accountability is going up.

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:35.460
But for things to get better,

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:38.060
we're going to have to
be proactive about it.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:41.930
And I have to admit that
it's even hard for me

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:45.100
an eternal optimist,
to be optimistic about,

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:47.300
the things that I'm seeing on TV,

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:50.650
last night, today, and probably tomorrow.

00:13:50.650 --> 00:13:52.130
But what can we do?

00:13:52.130 --> 00:13:54.770
Well, first, record everything.

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:58.000
If you're going to take to
the streets, do so peacefully.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:00.430
And please stop the looters.

00:14:00.430 --> 00:14:03.000
Civil Disobedience not only exists

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.200
to fight the government itself,

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:07.700
but also to fight your fellow man

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.200
when they're being unreasonable.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:13.260
And if you are going
out, please wear a mask.

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:15.020
I really, really hope
we're out of the woods

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:16.550
with respect to COVID.

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:18.340
But this could turn bad.

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:21.180
We might have to go into quarantine again.

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:24.520
I'm truly conflicted, because I think

00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:28.240
a lot of this cause is just
and it's fighting injustice,

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:30.460
but the consequences are real.

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:32.590
So please be responsible for yourself.

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:34.800
And with respect to other protesters,

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:37.990
do what you can to not
only protected them,

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:40.280
but to protect other people's property

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:43.500
and to record injustice
wherever you see it,

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:47.750
and to publish it so that we
have at least a record of it.

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:51.300
To the members of the armed
citizens who may be asked

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:55.200
to turn their weapons against
other American citizens,

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:58.710
I ask you to reflect and think about

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:00.510
your actions before you take them.

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:03.410
That the highest form
of civil disobedience

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:06.920
is to reject an unlawful order.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.770
And you may be asked to do so.

00:15:08.770 --> 00:15:12.050
It's not fair, but we all have

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.890
to play the hands that were dealt.

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:17.610
And that unfortunately,
the Federal military

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:20.020
is probably going to be the
tip of the spear on this.

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:22.580
The same goes for the
DC police department,

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:24.480
the Metropolitan Police Department.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:29.050
You don't have to do what
we're seeing officers on TV do,

00:15:29.050 --> 00:15:30.780
there's always a choice.

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:33.700
And for everyone else,
continue speaking out.

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:38.220
I am continually astonished
by the outpouring of support

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:42.770
that people have given to this
cause and and rightfully so.

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:45.720
And we're Of course, hearing
from the usual suspects.

00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:47.930
It's no surprise the people

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:50.650
that are in support of these things.

00:15:50.650 --> 00:15:53.380
But there are some groups of
people who I haven't heard from

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:54.600
that I would like to.

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:57.250
Where are all of those
Second Amendment supporters

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:59.950
who were so vocal just
a couple of weeks ago

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:02.540
and who are so silent now,

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:05.000
when you were asking for

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:08.370
a tyrannical government to fight against,

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:10.090
well, now is your chance.

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:13.150
If you stay at home, thinking
that the Second Amendment

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:16.030
is more important than
the First Amendment,

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:17.480
I feel sorry for you.

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:19.610
And I think that you should
come to the conclusion that,

00:16:19.610 --> 00:16:22.340
your fantasy of being a
good guy with a gun fighting

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:24.800
a tyrannical government, is just that.

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:26.560
It's just a fantasy.

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:29.670
If you were willing to
protest a few weeks ago,

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:31.840
you should be willing
to fight police abuse

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:34.670
and systemic violence out there today.

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:39.350
And where are all of those
freedom of religion folks?

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:42.150
The irony of what happened
yesterday is that,

00:16:42.150 --> 00:16:44.260
in order to clear out the protesters,

00:16:44.260 --> 00:16:47.690
the federal government used
federal officers to clear out

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:51.710
the actual priest who was in
charge of St George's church,

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:54.980
and then the President held
out a Bible without opening it,

00:16:54.980 --> 00:16:56.280
without reading from it.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:59.610
If that's not blasphemy,
I don't know what is.

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:03.710
Why aren't you being vocal
about this abuse of religion

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:05.380
for political ends?

00:17:05.380 --> 00:17:06.970
And where are all of the folks

00:17:06.970 --> 00:17:09.610
who claim to care about law and order?

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:13.340
What we saw last night
was pure lawlessness.

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:15.520
Just because the federal
government does it,

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:16.780
doesn't mean that it should.

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:18.380
And it doesn't mean that it was legal

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:20.000
and doesn't mean that it was right.

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:23.890
If you care about a rule of
law that applies to everyone,

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:27.090
you ought to be appalled at
what happened last night.

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:31.490
And besides speaking out, if
you could donate to the ACLU,

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:34.010
I'll put a link in the description,

00:17:34.010 --> 00:17:35.580
I would greatly appreciate it.

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:38.250
I think there are a lot of
folks who are going to need

00:17:38.250 --> 00:17:41.230
some good legal representation
before all of this is out,

00:17:41.230 --> 00:17:44.520
and I will give to the ACLU as well.

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:48.420
By now you've probably seen this photo.

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:52.070
The lights were dark at
the White House last night.

00:17:52.070 --> 00:17:53.270
But the lights have been dark

00:17:53.270 --> 00:17:55.860
at the White House for a long time.

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:58.110
Let's do what we can to
bring the light back.

